{"id": "hotel-assessment-and-transfer-tax-refunds", "title": "Two rewritten settlements raised three hotel-property refund authorizations to $3,485,090", "seconds": 64.8, "voice": "elevenlabs:exurTFaGNF2gnRcPNH8I", "narrator": "Phil", "made": "2026-11-28", "key": "3d5ef0aa69de7ab1", "words": 182, "beats": [{"scene": "p", "kind": "hook", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "The 2019 ownership changes at three San Francisco hotels produced five settlement ordinances.", "t0": 0.2, "t1": 5.55, "shot": "s0", "visual": {"type": "hook", "words": ["Five", "ordinances,", "three", "properties"], "sub": "Three addresses led to six court cases"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.11, 0.44, 0.88, 1.37, 1.8, 1.92, 2.21, 2.4, 2.89, 3.39, 3.81, 4.2, 4.63]}, {"scene": "p", "kind": "compare", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "At each address there were two lawsuits, one over the assessment and one over transfer tax.", "t0": 5.67, "t1": 10.82, "shot": "s1", "visual": {"type": "compare", "rows": [["Assessment suits", "3"], ["Transfer tax suits", "3"]]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.16, 0.36, 0.74, 0.89, 1.03, 1.22, 2.28, 2.51, 2.69, 2.8, 3.55, 3.82, 4.01, 4.23, 4.66]}, {"scene": "p", "kind": "compare", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "The Geary property alone occupied two separate lots.", "t0": 10.94, "t1": 13.95, "shot": "s2", "visual": {"type": "compare", "rows": [["Geary lot", "0305-008"], ["Geary lot", "0305-009"]]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.14, 0.46, 0.88, 1.31, 1.82, 2.1, 2.48]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "In December, two new laws replaced settlements the City had approved a month earlier.", "t0": 14.17, "t1": 18.5, "shot": "s3", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "north", "kicker": "Two laws replaced earlier settlements", "text": "Two explicit repeals", "mark": "Two"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.19, 0.7, 0.98, 1.18, 1.48, 1.89, 2.35, 2.49, 2.75, 2.87, 3.3, 3.38, 3.62]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "compare", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "At North Point, the authorized refund rose to $983,430.", "t0": 18.62, "t1": 24.52, "shot": "s4", "visual": {"type": "compare", "rows": [["Earlier refund", "$943,740"], ["December refund", "$983,430"]]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.21, 0.49, 1.28, 1.47, 2.07, 2.54, 2.81, 3.0, 3.28, 3.59, 4.03, 4.53, 4.76, 5.05, 5.35]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "compare", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "At Battery, the increase was exactly twice as large.", "t0": 24.64, "t1": 27.88, "shot": "s5", "visual": {"type": "compare", "rows": [["Earlier refund", "$1,636,749"], ["December refund", "$1,716,129"]]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.22, 0.88, 1.05, 1.41, 1.58, 2.01, 2.37, 2.52]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "Each increase was 4.41 percent of the reduction in the agreed property value.", "t0": 28.0, "t1": 32.75, "shot": "s6", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "4.41%", "label": "Both revisions move in exactly the same proportion"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.29, 0.73, 0.93, 1.18, 1.45, 1.79, 1.97, 2.38, 2.48, 2.6, 3.09, 3.18, 3.28, 3.63, 4.06]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "The transfer tax rate in 2019 was three percent at these values.", "t0": 32.87, "t1": 36.66, "shot": "s7", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "north", "kicker": "Both revisions move in exactly the same proportion", "text": "Rate at the ownership change", "mark": "Rate"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.2, 0.64, 0.95, 1.17, 1.29, 1.58, 2.01, 2.21, 2.5, 2.9, 3.02, 3.23]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "The higher six percent rate took effect in 2021. The settlement math remains unexplained.", "t0": 36.78, "t1": 42.55, "shot": "s8", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "north", "kicker": "Both revisions move in exactly the same proportion", "text": "The later tax schedule", "mark": "The"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.16, 0.49, 0.72, 1.08, 1.28, 1.47, 1.88, 2.05, 2.38, 3.71, 3.9, 4.33, 4.64, 5.05]}, {"scene": "o", "kind": "compare", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "established[3]"], "text": "Across all three properties, the surviving refund authorizations totaled about three and a half million dollars.", "t0": 42.77, "t1": 48.59, "shot": "s9", "visual": {"type": "compare", "rows": [["North Point", "$983,430"], ["Battery", "$1,716,129"], ["Geary", "$785,531"]]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.44, 0.62, 0.87, 1.8, 1.96, 2.47, 2.81, 3.57, 3.9, 4.14, 4.38, 4.48, 4.56, 4.76, 5.06]}, {"scene": "o", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "established[3]"], "text": "The secured tax roll has 76 rows for the four lots. They do not record a refund check.", "t0": 48.71, "t1": 54.75, "shot": "s10", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "roll", "kicker": "Four parcels can be traced without mistaking assessed values for payments", "text": "Four lots on the roll", "mark": "Four"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.22, 0.69, 1.06, 1.33, 1.54, 2.22, 2.53, 2.67, 2.79, 3.02, 3.97, 4.19, 4.34, 4.52, 4.93, 5.03, 5.41]}, {"scene": "o", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "established[3]"], "text": "Each law added statutory interest. The records still needed are the final assessment approvals and the payment entries.", "t0": 54.87, "t1": 61.44, "shot": "s11", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "Refund check"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.31, 0.55, 0.86, 1.53, 2.78, 2.97, 3.29, 3.56, 3.93, 4.1, 4.24, 4.54, 4.97, 5.47, 5.61, 5.72, 6.09]}, {"scene": "o", "kind": "end", "ref": ["status"], "text": "Every source is linked in the case file below.", "t0": 61.56, "t1": 63.93, "shot": "end", "visual": {"type": "end"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.32, 0.72, 0.94, 1.27, 1.38, 1.49, 1.76, 2.01]}], "format": 6, "chapters": {"p": "Three addresses led to six court cases", "b": "Two laws replaced earlier settlements", "o": "Four parcels can be traced without mistaking assessed values for payments"}, "look": "newsroom", "hook": "document"}